334155;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;edgeStyle=none;strokeColor=#b91c1c;fontColor=#b91c1c;exitX=0.75;exitY=0;entryX=0.8799;entryY=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c40" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value="«package» tools/CrabShare.DbMigrator&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;DbUp runner for database/migrations/V*.sql&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=folder;fontStyle=1;spacingTop=10;tabWidth=60;tabHeight=16;tabPosition=left;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="920" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c49" value="«package» tools/CrabShare.Load&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;concurrent API / settlement load runner&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=folder;fontStyle=1;spacingTop=10;tabWidth=60;tabHeight=16;tabPosition=left;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="285" y="920" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" value="«package» tests&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;CrabShare.Api.Tests (WebApplicationFactory, [Category=Database]) · CrabShare.SettlementEngine.Tests (xUnit + FsCheck)&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=folder;fontStyle=1;spacingTop=10;tabWidth=60;tabHeight=16;tabPosition=left;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="550" y="920" width="265" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="«package» CrabShare.SettlementEngine&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;SettlementCalculator · LargestRemainderAllocator — no database, no framework&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=folder;fontStyle=1;spacingTop=10;tabWidth=60;tabHeight=16;tabPosition=left;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="920" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="52" value="«import»" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.96;entryY=0;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c51"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="545" y="304"/><mxPoint x="1070" y="304"/><mxPoint x="1070" y="920"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="53" value="" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;edgeStyle=none;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c50" target="c51"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="54" value="" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;edgeStyle=none;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.6245;entryY=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c50" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="55" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Folder = package · dashed arrow = «use» dependency, numbered as in Table 4.5 (2/2) part (b) · red arrow = cycle or layer breach in code · grey dashed, labelled «planned» = in Register v1.4, not in code yet (P1, P2)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="70" width="420" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="56" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Features &lt;b&gt;do&lt;/b&gt; call each other's services directly where a flow crosses modules (Table 4.5). The v2.0 sentence &quot;Features never reference each other's services directly&quot; was wrong.&lt;br&gt;• Payment confirmations come back through the IPaymentPurposeHandler interface (implemented in Funding and Orders), so Payments does not depend on those modules.&lt;br&gt;• Red = cycle or layer breach in code: Payments ⇄ Settlement (11, 12), Common → Alerts (13), Infrastructure → Alerts and Evidence (14). Table 4.5 (2/2) part (c) proposes how to remove them; not done yet.&lt;br&gt;• Box rows and the farm map query (UC25) are planned parts of Batches; the pre-order quota and holds are planned parts of Orders. They add no module dependency.&lt;br&gt;• Removed in v1.4, still in code, not drawn: the Catalog and Offtake modules with their dependencies (Orders ⇄ Catalog, Catalog → Alerts, Offtake → Payments, Orders and Funding, Harvest → Catalog); tags in Harvest (TagsController, TagsService); PreorderBalanceJob and PreorderBalanceService in Orders.&lt;br&gt;• Infrastructure/Persistence/Entities is generated by EF scaffold and not edited by hand.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead (Batch opening condition, box rows, forfeited deposits, InvoicedSale)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="170" width="420" height="370" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Table 4.5 (1 of 2) – Backend packages" id="Table_4_5__1_of_2____Backend_packages"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Table 4.5 (1/2) – Backend packages of Figure 4.5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · code: develop @ 420a379 · owners from docs/feature-map.md and the task packages of Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1280" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;b&gt;(a) Packages&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="66" width="1280" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:180px;&quot;&gt;Package&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:430px;&quot;&gt;Responsibility&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:520px;&quot;&gt;Main classes / folders&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:150px;&quot;&gt;Owner&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Program.cs · Common/FeatureRegistry.cs&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Composition root: builds the pipeline (authentication, CORS, rate limiter, ProblemDetails) and registers every feature service, payment-purpose handler and job&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Program, FeatureRegistry&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Auth&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Login, registration, JWT, roles (UC01)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;AuthController, AuthService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Accounts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;eKYC, payout accounts, delivery addresses, user administration (UC02, UC03, UC06)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;AccountsController, AccountService, PaymentProfilesController, PaymentProfileService, AdminAccountsController, AdminAccountService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Operators&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Farm registration, members, admin review (UC04, UC05)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;OperatorsController, OperatorService, AdminOperatorsController, OperatorReviewService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Boxes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Box numbering and registration (UC44)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;BoxesController, BoxService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Batches&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Create a Batch, lock the Standard Cost, admin approval, explore, fee tiers, tranche schedule (UC07–UC09); box rows of the Batch (boxes grouped by row code) and the farm map query within the delivery radius «planned» (UC25)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;BatchesController, BatchService, BatchReviewService, BatchExploreService, FeeTiersController, FeeTierService, FundingReadiness, TrancheScheduleJob; BoxRow, FarmMapController, FarmMapService «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên; farm map: Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Funding&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Reservation (30 minutes) and contribution, funding close when the minimum viable capital and the pre-order ratio are reached, refunds otherwise (UC10–UC12); contribution by box rows with row allocation «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FundingController, FundingService, FundingCloseService, FundingCloseJob, FundingAdminService, ContributionPaymentHandler; RowAllocation «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Contracts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Contract template, PDF, sequential signing (UC14, UC15)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;ContractsController, ContractService, ContractVoiding&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Payments&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;VietQR payment requests, idempotent webhook, refunds, disbursement tranches, payouts (UC18, UC40)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;PaymentsController, PaymentRequestService, PaymentWebhookController, PaymentWebhookService, IPaymentPurposeHandler, RefundService, DisbursementService, PayoutSendService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Settlement&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Settlement calculation, review, feedback and payout (UC35–UC39); revenue lines and remuneration tiers «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;SettlementsController, SettlementService, SettlementReviewService, SettlementPayoutService, AdminSettlementsController&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Portfolio&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Investor portfolio and notifications (UC16)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;PortfolioController, PortfolioService, NotificationsController, NotificationService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Production&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Stocking, daily logs, box events, Batch timeline (UC17, UC21)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;ProductionLogsController, ProductionLogService, SlotEventsController, SlotEventService, StockingService, TimelineService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Evidence&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Live capture, random capture requests, explanations, flagged-evidence review (UC45, UC47, UC48)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;EvidenceController, EvidenceService, CaptureRequestService, CaptureRequestWorker, EvidenceReviewService, EvidenceExplanationService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Alerts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Raise, acknowledge and escalate alerts (UC19, UC20)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;AlertsController, AdminAlertsController, AlertService, AlertJobWorker&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Harvest&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Harvest record per box (UC22) and public trace (UC33)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;HarvestController, HarvestService, TraceController, TraceService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Orders&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Pre-orders with deposit, delivery, return, complaints, rating (UC27–UC34); bulk pre-order by crab count with the pre-order quota and 15-minute holds, weighing, forfeited deposits, invoiced sales (low grade or resale after a forfeit), the final order and the order QR «planned» (UC50, UC51, UC54)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;PreordersController, PreorderService, OrdersController, OrderQueryService, OperatorOrdersController, OrderFulfilmentService, OrderReturnService, ComplaintService, OrderRatingService, ReservationExpiryJob, OrderCompletionJob, ComplaintEscalationJob; PreOrderQuota, PreOrderHold, InvoicedSaleService, FinalOrderReminderJob «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Nhân&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Admin&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Dashboards, audit log viewer, exports (UC41–UC43)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;DashboardControllers (two classes), DashboardService, AuditLogController&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi; UC41: Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Health&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Liveness, readiness and version endpoints&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;HealthController&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Price Module &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«planned»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Price range per kg from 2–3 years of prices with backtest MAPE, shown as a range with a warning (UC49)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;PriceSuggestionsController, PriceSuggestionService, SeasonalPriceModel, PriceBacktester&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Nhân&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Ingestion &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«planned»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;One common API for the Device &amp;amp; Camera Simulator: logs, box events and photos, idempotent per message (UC52)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;IngestionController, IngestionService, IngestionEnvelope&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Common&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Cross-cutting code: JWT auth and role policies, ICurrentUser, audit log with hash chain, alert port, errors as ProblemDetails, recurring jobs, paging, CSV export&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Auth, Auditing (IAuditLog, AuditLogService, AuditChainCheckJob), Alerts (IAlertRaiser, AlertServiceRaiser), Errors, Jobs (RecurringJob), Paging, Exports&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;all; audit log and jobs: Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Infrastructure&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Ports and adapters: persistence (EF Core 10, database-first), storage, payment, signing, eKYC, crab detection, security&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Persistence (AppDbContext, Entities), Storage (LocalFileStorage, CloudinaryFileStorage), Payments, Signing, Ekyc (Fake adapters), Detection (ICrabDetector), Security, DependencyInjection&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;all; detection: Nhân&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CrabShare.SettlementEngine&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Pure settlement library without database or framework&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;SettlementCalculator, LargestRemainderAllocator&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện; research tests: Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;tests&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;API integration tests and settlement-engine property tests&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CrabShare.Api.Tests (WebApplicationFactory, [Category=Database]), CrabShare.SettlementEngine.Tests (xUnit + FsCheck)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;all; engine tests: Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;tools/CrabShare.DbMigrator&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Runs database/migrations/V*.sql with DbUp; refuses --reset outside LocalDB&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;DbMigrator (DbUp)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;tools/CrabShare.Load&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Concurrent API and settlement load runner&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Load runner&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Nhân&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;overflow=visible;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="90" width="1280" height="939" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" value="Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead (Funding: Batch opening condition and box rows; Batches: box rows; Orders: forfeited deposits, weighed-kg balance, InvoicedSale)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1041" width="1280" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Table 4.5 (2 of 2) – Backend dependencies and refactoring" id="Table_4_5__2_of_2____Backend_dependencies_and_refactoring"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Table 4.5 (2/2) – Backend cross-module dependencies and planned refactoring (Figure 4.5)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · code: develop @ 420a379 · owners from docs/feature-map.md and the task packages of Register v1.4&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1280" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;b&gt;(b) Cross-module dependencies — the number is the label of the arrow in Figure 4.5&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="66" width="1280" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:44px;&quot;&gt;#&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:220px;&quot;&gt;From → To&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:836px;&quot;&gt;Code reference (class or member)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:180px;&quot;&gt;Kind&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Funding → Payments&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FundingService(PaymentRequestService); FundingCloseService(RefundService); ContributionPaymentHandler : IPaymentPurposeHandler&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;service call&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Funding → Contracts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;ContractVoiding.VoidUnsignedAsync in FundingService and FundingCloseService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;static helper&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Orders → Payments&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;PreorderService, OrderQueryService(PaymentRequestService); ComplaintService, OrderCancellationService, OrderReturnService(RefundService); PreOrderDepositHandler, PreOrderBalanceHandler : IPaymentPurposeHandler&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;service call&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Harvest → Batches&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;BatchService.Validate&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;static helper&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Production → Batches&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;BatchService.Validate; FundingReadiness in StockingService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;static helper&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Production → Alerts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;ProductionLogService(AlertService), SlotEventService(AlertService)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;service call&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Production → Boxes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;BoxRangeRequest in StockingDtos&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;DTO&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Production → Evidence&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TimelineService(EvidenceImageReader)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;service call&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Evidence → Alerts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;CaptureRequestJob(AlertService)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;service call&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Payments → Batches&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FundingReadiness.ReadyAt in DisbursementService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;static helper&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;11&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Payments → Settlement&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;SettlementClosing.CloseIfPaidAsync in PayoutSendService&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;cycle with 12&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;12&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Settlement → Payments&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;SettlementPayoutService(PayoutSendService)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;cycle with 11&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;13&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Common → Alerts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;AlertServiceRaiser forwards IAlertRaiser to Features/Alerts AlertService; IAlertRaiser takes AlertType and AlertSeverity from Features/Alerts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;layer breach&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;14&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Infrastructure → Alerts, Evidence&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;DependencyInjection registers AlertJobWorker, CaptureRequestWorker and their options&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;layer breach&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;15&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Common ⇄ Infrastructure&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;AuditLogService, AuditChain use AppDbContext; DependencyInjection, SecuritySetup use Common&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;mutual&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;P1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Ingestion → Production&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;IngestionService uses ProductionLogService and SlotEventService for simulator logs and box events (UC52); photos go through IFileStorage&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«planned»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;P2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Orders → Alerts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;FinalOrderReminderJob raises FinalOrderDue through AlertService when the sales window closes (UC51)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«planned»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;overflow=visible;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="90" width="1280" height="404" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" value="Removed in v1.4, still in code, not drawn: Orders ⇄ Catalog (OrderService(LowStockMonitor), CatalogService.SellUntil; OrderRatingService.ExtractForListing), Catalog → Alerts (LowStockMonitor), Offtake → Payments, Orders, Funding (OfftakeService, OfftakeDepositHandler, OrderService.LineAmount, FundingOptions) and Harvest → Catalog (HarvestService(CatalogService)). They disappear when the Catalog and Offtake modules are deleted." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="506" width="1280" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" value="&lt;b&gt;(c) Planned refactoring — decision proposal; the figure changes only after the code changes&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="560" width="1280" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:44px;&quot;&gt;#&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:260px;&quot;&gt;Cycle or breach in code&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:740px;&quot;&gt;Proposal (decision for the team, not done)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:236px;&quot;&gt;Result&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Payments ⇄ Settlement (11, 12)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Add a payout-completed port in Common (for example IPayoutCompletedHandler), as IPaymentPurposeHandler already does for incoming payments. Settlement implements it to close the settlement when every payout is paid; PayoutSendService calls the port instead of SettlementClosing.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;removes 11; only Settlement → Payments stays&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Common → Alerts (13)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Move AlertType and AlertSeverity next to IAlertRaiser in Common/Alerts, and move AlertServiceRaiser into Features/Alerts, registered by FeatureRegistry.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Common no longer references Features&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Infrastructure → Alerts, Evidence (14)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Register AlertJobWorker and CaptureRequestWorker (and their options) in FeatureRegistry, like the other feature jobs.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Infrastructure no longer references Features&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Common ⇄ Infrastructure (15)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Move the AppDbContext-based parts of Common/Auditing (AuditLogService, AuditChain, AuditChainCheckJob) into Infrastructure; Common keeps the IAuditLog interface.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;only Infrastructure → Common stays&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;overflow=visible;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="584" width="1280" height="184" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Package Diagram – Web" id="Package_Diagram___Web"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1"