ogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#b91c1c;fontColor=#b91c1c;exitX=0;exitY=0.3;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="26" y="329"/><mxPoint x="26" y="172"/><mxPoint x="345" y="172"/><mxPoint x="345" y="72"/><mxPoint x="1215" y="72"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="45" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; — folder = package · dashed arrow = import dependency, numbered as in Table 4.6 part (b) · red arrow = breaks the layering rule · grey dashed, labelled «planned» = in Register v1.4, not in code yet." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="580" width="1350" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="46" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Features call the API only through shared/api/http.ts (token attached, 401 → logout); role gating is in app/router.tsx with RequireRole.&lt;br&gt;• Features &lt;b&gt;do&lt;/b&gt; import each other (Table 4.6 part (b)): most imports go to operator, which holds the Batch, box and harvest API clients.&lt;br&gt;• Red: shared/ui/kit imports features/landing (settle()), so the v2.0 rule &quot;shared UI never imports from features&quot; does not hold; Table 4.6 part (c) proposes a fix (not done).&lt;br&gt;• Removed in v1.4, still in code, not drawn: features/store (StorePage, listings), shared/cart, the orders checkout, investor offtake, operator tags and listings, and their imports orders → store (7 files), store → operator (2) and shared/auth → shared/cart." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="630" width="1350" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Table 4.6 – Web packages" id="Table_4_6___Web_packages"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Table 4.6 – Web packages, cross-feature imports and planned refactoring (Figure 4.6)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · code: develop @ 420a379 · imports measured in web/src; owners from docs/feature-map.md and git history&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1280" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;b&gt;(a) Packages&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="66" width="1280" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:190px;&quot;&gt;Package&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:460px;&quot;&gt;Responsibility&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:480px;&quot;&gt;Main files&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:150px;&quot;&gt;Owner&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;app&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Router with lazy routes per role (RequireRole) and the TanStack Query provider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;router.tsx, providers.tsx, index.css&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;shared/api&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;The only HTTP client: axios with the JWT header, 401 → logout&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;http.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;shared/auth&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Session store and role guard&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;authStore.ts, session.tsx, RequireRole.tsx&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;shared/ui · kit&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;UI kit, dialogs, breadcrumbs&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;kit/, ActionDialog.tsx, Breadcrumbs.tsx&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;shared/lib&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Formatting and money (integer VND)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;format.ts, money.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;shared/contracts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Contract viewer and its API client&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;ContractViewer.tsx, contractsApi.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;shared/settlement&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Settlement statement and feedback list&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;SettlementStatement.tsx, SettlementFeedbackList.tsx, settlementApi.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;shared/payments&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;VietQR box and the simulated-transfer button&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;VietQrBox.tsx, SimulatePaymentButton.tsx, paymentsApi.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện, Nhân&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;shared/layout&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Site chrome&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;SiteChrome.tsx&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/accounts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;KYC, payout account, delivery addresses&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;KycVerification.tsx, PayoutAccountForm.tsx, CustomerAddresses.tsx&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/trace&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Public trace page; opened by the order QR «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;TracePage.tsx, traceApi.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/reports&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Dashboard API client&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;dashboardApi.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/landing&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Landing page with the settlement demo&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Landing.tsx, HeroGL.tsx, settlement.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/investor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Investor portal: Batches, funding, contracts, portfolio, notifications, settlement; box rows and own-row box details «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;InvestorPortal.tsx, batches/, funding/, contracts/, portfolio/, notifications/, settlement/&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện, Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/operator&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Operator workspace: create Batch, cost, boxes, logs, evidence, harvest, orders, disbursements, settlement; price suggestion, floor price and tiers «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;OperatorCreateBatch.tsx, CostScheduleEditor.tsx, OperatorBatchDetail.tsx, OperatorDailyLog.tsx, OperatorEvidence.tsx, HarvestResultPanel.tsx, …&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên, Nhân, Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/admin&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Admin console: users, operators, Batches, finance, evidence, alerts, disputes, settings, audit log&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;AdminDashboard.tsx, AdminBatches.tsx, AdminFinance.tsx, AdminEvidence.tsx, AdminDisputes.tsx, AdminAuditLog.tsx, …&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi, Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/auth&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Login, registration, demo accounts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;LoginPage.tsx, RegisterPage.tsx, demoAccounts.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/timeline&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Batch timeline with evidence media&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;BatchTimeline.tsx, EvidenceMedia.tsx, timelineApi.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/orders&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Customer pre-order, tracking, rating, complaints; bulk pre-order by crab count «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;PreorderPage.tsx, OrderTrackingPage.tsx, OrderHistoryPage.tsx, RateOrderPage.tsx, ordersApi.ts, complaintsApi.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Nhân&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/alerts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Alerts API client&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;api.ts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/farm map &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«planned»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Customer map of farms whose delivery radius covers the address (UC25)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;—&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;overflow=visible;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="90" width="1280" height="561" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" value="&lt;b&gt;(b) Cross-feature imports — the number is the label of the arrow in Figure 4.6&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fo