ell><mxCell id="23" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Each feature exposes a repository interface with a Mock and an Api implementation; switching is one Riverpod provider line.&lt;br&gt;• Evidence is captured with the camera only (image_picker, no gallery) and carries GPS (geolocator); QR scan uses mobile_scanner.&lt;br&gt;• Red: features and shared import app/routes.dart and app/theme while app/router.dart imports the feature pages, so app ⇄ features is a folder-level cycle; core/api and core/auth also import each other. Table 4.7 part (b) proposes a fix (not done).&lt;br&gt;• Removed in v1.4, still in code, not drawn: operator/tags and operator/packing (packing by tag code)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="670" width="1080" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Table 4.7 – Mobile packages" id="Table_4_7___Mobile_packages"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Table 4.7 – Mobile packages and planned refactoring (Figure 4.7)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · code: develop @ 420a379 · owners from docs/feature-map.md and git history&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1280" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;b&gt;(a) Packages&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="66" width="1280" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:210px;&quot;&gt;Package&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:470px;&quot;&gt;Responsibility&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:450px;&quot;&gt;Main files&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:150px;&quot;&gt;Owner&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;app&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;App shell: role-based StatefulShellRoute router, route names, theme&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;app.dart, router.dart, routes.dart, theme/app_theme.dart, theme/app_images.dart&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;shared&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Shared models and widgets (gauge, cards, navigation shell)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;models/batch_enums.dart, widgets/app_ui.dart, widgets/nav_shell.dart, widgets/segmented_gauge.dart&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;core&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;API client (Dio + JWT), session and secure storage, formatting&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;api/api_client.dart, auth/session.dart, auth/auth_repository.dart, format/dates.dart, format/money.dart&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi, Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/auth&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Login and demo accounts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;login_page.dart, demo_accounts.dart&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/onboarding&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Onboarding page&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;onboarding_page.dart&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/account&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Account and payout account&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;account_page.dart, payout_account_page.dart, data/payout_repository.dart&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/investor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Home, Batches, portfolio, eKYC, notifications; own-row box details «planned» (UC53)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;home/, batches/, portfolio/, kyc/, notifications/, data/&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Khôi, Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/operator&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Today, daily logs, box events, camera-only evidence, harvest per box, alerts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;today/, logs/, slot_events/, evidence/, harvest/, alerts/, data/&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên, Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/trace&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;QR scan and trace result; order QR «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;scan_page.dart, trace_result_page.dart, trace_code_parser.dart, trace_repository.dart&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Viên&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/common&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Page for an unsupported role&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;unsupported_role_page.dart&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features/operator delivery &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«planned»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Weighing on delivery and transit loss (UC29)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;—&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Nhân&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;overflow=visible;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="90" width="1280" height="348" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" value="Removed in v1.4, still in code, not described: operator/tags and operator/packing." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="450" width="1280" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" value="&lt;b&gt;(b) Planned refactoring — decision proposal; the figure changes only after the code changes&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="488" width="1280" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:44px;&quot;&gt;#&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:260px;&quot;&gt;Cycle in code&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:740px;&quot;&gt;Proposal (decision for the team, not done)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border:1px solid #94a3b8;background:#e2e8f0;padding:3px 5px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:236px;&quot;&gt;Result&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;app ⇄ features, shared → app&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Move the route names (app/routes.dart) and the theme (app/theme) into core, for example core/routing and core/theme; app keeps only app.dart and router.dart.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;features and shared import only core&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;core/api ⇄ core/auth&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Move session.dart (token store) out of core/auth into its own folder, so core/api reads the token from it and core/auth depends on core/api and the session.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;no cycle inside core&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;overflow=visible;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="512" width="1280" height="99" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>